    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-is42">
        <head xml:id="gom-is42-Hd1e98">Caput 42</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-is42-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-is42-Hd1e102">Versus 1</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is42-d1e104">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1284B"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is42-Qd1e108" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is42_1@1-2">Ecce servus.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is42-Rd1e111"><name xml:id="gom-is42-Nd1e112" ref="#Jerome">HIER.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is42-Qd1e115">Notandum quia apostoli Jacob, Israel, et semen Abrahae appellantur, quibus postea quasi servis et hominibus dicitur: <quote xml:id="gom-is42-Qd1e117" source="http://scta.info/resource/is41_14@1-4">Noli timere, vermis Jacob,</quote> etc. Christus autem non semen Jacob vel Israel, sed servus dicitur.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is42-d1e122">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is42-Qd1e124" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is42_1@14-15">Dedi Spiritum.</quote>
            In conceptione; unde: <quote xml:id="gom-is42-Qd1e127" source="http://scta.info/resource/lc1_35@6-10">Spiritus sanctus superveniet in te,</quote> etc. <!--<note>(Phil. II)</note>-->. Et in baptismo claruit, cum Spiritus in specie columbae super ipsum requievit <!--<note>(Luc. I)</note>-->.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is42-Dd1e136">
          <head xml:id="gom-is42-Hd1e138">Versus 3</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is42-d1e140">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is42-Qd1e142" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is42_3@6-7">Linum fumigans.</quote>
            Sacerdotium jam pene exstinctum, de lino autem fit sacerdotale vestimentum.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is42-d1e146">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is42-Qd1e148" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is42_3@12-13">Educet judicium.</quote>
            Judicabit, scilicet non metuens Scribas et Pharisaeos.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is42-Dd1e153">
          <head xml:id="gom-is42-Hd1e155">Versus 4</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is42-d1e157">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is42-Qd1e159" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is42_4@1-3">Non erit tristis.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is42-Rd1e162"><name xml:id="gom-is42-Nd1e163" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is42-Qd1e166">Hoc Matthaeus <pb ed="#P" n="1284C"/> non posuit, sive inter judicium et judicium media scriptoris errore sublata sunt. Est autem sensus, aequalitatem vultus omni tempore conservabit: Quod de Socrate falso gloriantur philosophi, quod scilicet plus solito non tristis fuerit, nec laetus.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is42-d1e172">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is42-Qd1e174" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is42_4@8-10">In terra judicium.</quote>
            Unde: <quote xml:id="gom-is42-Qd1e177" source="http://scta.info/resource/io9_39@4-15">In judicium ego veni in hunc mundum, ut qui non vident videant,</quote> etc. <!--<note>(Joan. IX)</note>-->.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is42-Dd1e184">
          <head xml:id="gom-is42-Hd1e186">Versus 6</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is42-d1e188">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is42-Qd1e190" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is42_6@6-6">Justitia.</quote>
            Justum fuit ut transiret per apostolos ad gentes contemptus a Judaeis.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is42-Dd1e196">
          <head xml:id="gom-is42-Hd1e198">Versus 7</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is42-d1e200">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is42-Qd1e202" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is42_7@9-9">Vinctum.</quote>
            Funibus peccatorum: in Evangelio, quem Satanas vinxerat Dominus solvit.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is42-Dd1e207">
          <head xml:id="gom-is42-Hd1e209">Versus 8</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is42-d1e211">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is42-Qd1e213" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is42_8@9-9">Alteri.</quote>
            Filius et Spiritus sanctus in Deitate a Patre alter non est, et ideo eamdem et gloriam <pb ed="#P" n="1284D"/> et laudem habet.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is42-Dd1e220">
          <head xml:id="gom-is42-Hd1e222">Versus 9</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is42-d1e224">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1284D"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is42-Qd1e228" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is42_9@13-14">Vobis faciam.</quote>
            Ut sciatis, quia ego Dominus, non est alius praeter me: et qui priora cernitis impleta, credatis quae polliceor futura.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is42-Dd1e233">
          <head xml:id="gom-is42-Hd1e235">Versus 10</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is42-d1e237">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is42-Qd1e239" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is42_10@4-4">Novum.</quote>
            In novitate Spiritus, non in vestustate litterae; nec solum in Veteri Testamento, sed etiam in Novo.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is42-d1e243">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is42-Qd1e245" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is42_10@10-13">Qui descenditis in mare.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is42-Rd1e248"><name xml:id="gom-is42-Nd1e249" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is42-Qd1e252">Prius piscatores piscium, post hominum; unde ad litteram: multa maria transierunt.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is42-Dd1e256">
          <head xml:id="gom-is42-Hd1e258">Versus 11</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is42-d1e260">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is42-Qd1e262" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is42_11@9-9">Cedar.</quote>
            Filius Ismaelis: Saraceni ab eo, qui melius Agareni: sed nomine liberae velaverunt ignominiam ancillae. Ismael enim filius ancillae Agar fuit, ab hac Saraceni. Duodecim enim duces genuit. Nomine quoque ejus ipsa dicitur provincia.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is42-d1e266">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1285A"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is42-Qd1e270" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is42_11@13-15">De vertice montium.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is42-Rd1e273"><name xml:id="gom-is42-Nd1e274" ref="#Jerome">HIER.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is42-Qd1e277"><quote xml:id="gom-is42-Qd1e278">Super montem excelsum ascende. De vertice montis.</quote> De altitudine virtutis et contemplationis, ut etiam exemplo doceant quae praedicant.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is42-Dd1e283">
          <head xml:id="gom-is42-Hd1e285">Versus 13</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is42-d1e287">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is42-Qd1e289" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is42_13@10-10">Vociferabitur.</quote>
            Unde: <quote xml:id="gom-is42-Qd1e292" source="http://scta.info/resource/deut32_21@1-9">Ipsi me provocaverunt in eo qui non erat Deus</quote>; et ego in gente stulta irritabo eos.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is42-Dd1e298">
          <head xml:id="gom-is42-Hd1e300">Versus 14</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is42-d1e302">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is42-Qd1e304" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is42_14@6-7">Sicut parturiens.</quote>
            Partum consilii mei profundam in lucem sicut mulier infantem, sic proferam dissimulatum dolorem.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is42-Dd1e309">
          <head xml:id="gom-is42-Hd1e311">Versus 16</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is42-d1e313">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is42-Qd1e315" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is42_16@8-9">In semitis.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is42-Rd1e318"><name xml:id="gom-is42-Nd1e319" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is42-Qd1e322">In cognitione prophetarum, qui sunt semitae ad Christum, cum ejus nativitatem, resurrectionem et ascensionem praedicunt.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is42-Dd1e326">
          <head xml:id="gom-is42-Hd1e328">Versus 17</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is42-d1e330">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is42-Qd1e332" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is42_17">Confundantur. Cum plenitudo gentium intraverit.</quote>
            <!-- check: lemma not matched to verse text -->
            Tunc etiam Israel conversus, erroris sui <pb ed="#P" n="1285B"/> poenitebit, qui idolis ante servivit.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is42-Dd1e341">
          <head xml:id="gom-is42-Hd1e343">Versus 22</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is42-d1e345">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is42-Qd1e347" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is42_22@7-8">Laqueus juvenum.</quote>
            Revertitur ad praedicationem Domini, increpans Scribas et Pharisaeos: Hi enim erant laquei simplicibus ne ad Dominum converterentur.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is42-Dd1e352">
          <head xml:id="gom-is42-Hd1e354">Versus 23</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is42-d1e356">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is42-Qd1e358" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is42_23@1-2">Quis est.</quote>
            Hortatur eos propheta, ut saltem aliqui audiant et causam suae captivitatis intelligant et caveant.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is42-Dd1e363">
          <head xml:id="gom-is42-Hd1e365">Versus 25</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is42-d1e367">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is42-Qd1e369" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is42_25@3-4">Super eum.</quote>
            Ut quod prius tacuerat, jam non taceret nec verbis, sed tormentis corriperet.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is42-d1e373">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is42-Qd1e375" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is42_25@16-18">Et non cognovit.</quote>
            Sicut historiae tradunt, nec gentes hoc fieri in ultionem filii intellexerunt, nec Judaei malitia sua excaecati.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
